      "id": "claim_b8c58764b3d841eeba16d07ce34a45c0",
      "statement": "Trace context and baggage must be injected into and extracted from a transport carrier to connect work across service boundaries, whereas resource attributes identify the emitting service or deployment rather than an individual request.",
