    {
      "id": "claim_a1b745ca1b86437687a8c1a2da892478",
      "statement": "OTLP standardizes how telemetry is delivered over transports such as gRPC or HTTP with protobuf, while semantic conventions standardize field meaning; transport interoperability alone does not establish a shared schema.",
